      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PostgreSQL 18.6, database datapilot, schema ops: the shared state\nevents, event duplicates, jobs, runs (with any trace refusal), run events, approvals,\nposts, control, budgets, autonomy policy, knowledge versions, experiments (with the\ngate's recorded baseline), promotion decisions, improvement requests, live sessions,\nanalyzer candidates, rehearsal verifications, reset archives and their rows,\nschema migrations (written by the owner role only)",
